. *GESTATE IS A CONFOUNDER; dont remove from model but make sure to report on it
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. 
. *Final Model
. *After completing interaction and confounding checks, the final model is:
. 
. regress grams black smoke gestate blacksmoke

